    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "The desk. Everything that didn't fit anywhere else."
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "[shot:insert lamp]The lamp is on. It's late, or it's early."
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "A kaleidoscope rolls out from under the zine. The cheap cardboard kind, ducks printed on the paper, worn white at both ends."
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "Shake it and the bits inside rattle around."
    },
    {
      "t": "cg",
      "src": "assets/cg/vol4_meld_kaleidoscope_tube.jpg",
      "caption": "the tube, the lamp, the desk"
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "[shot:insert lamp]He puts it to his eye and points it at the lamp."
    },
    {
      "t": "bg",
      "src": "assets/backgrounds/vol4_meld_lens_mandala.jpg"
    },
    {
      "t": "interlude",
      "text": "·",
      "sub": "Small Wood · 1994 · transmission · Pasadena",
      "duration": 1800
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "a heron lifting off the sea wall\na minivan door sliding shut"
    },
    {
      "t": "bg",
      "src": "assets/backgrounds/vol1_city_color_night.jpg"
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "neon over a city at night\nthree friends walking into the color of it"
    },
    {
      "t": "bg",
      "src": "assets/backgrounds/vol3_hospital_room_night.jpg"
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "ducks on a television in a hospital room\nthe same pond going around"
    },
    {
      "t": "bg",
      "src": "assets/backgrounds/vol4_xerox_sky.jpg"
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "weep, FOR THE FUTURE struck through\ndistribute at your own peril"
    },
    {
      "t": "bg",
      "src": "assets/backgrounds/vol4_meld_lens_mandala.jpg"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "The Writer",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "A moment ago I was debating whether or not to begin."
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Aud",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "Everybody's here, hon."
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "Tiny little moments hidden out of sight, reflecting back a world of infinite possibility."
    },
    {
      "t": "flag",
      "key": "meld_lens_opened",
      "val": true
    },
    {
      "t": "choice",
      "prompt": "turn the lens.",
